# Nirva Deploy & Operations

## Production URLs

| Target | URL | Status |
|--------|-----|--------|
| Manus Space | https://ai.nirva.one | Deploy when ready |
| Health check | https://ai.nirva.one/api/health | Expect `version: 0.14.4` |
| API docs | https://ai.nirva.one/api/docs | Swagger UI |
| Demo hub | https://ai.nirva.one/demo | Feature showcase |

## Code freeze (CODE_FREEZE.md)

Feature freeze until production health returns 0.14.x.
**Allowed:** deploy, hotfix, DNS, env fixes
**Blocked:** new features, big refactors, v0.15 work
**Exception:** Cursor/MCP/Obsidian integration (v0.14.4)

## DO NOT deploy

Branch `claude/pensive-meitner-befe4h` — see `docs/CLAUDE_BRANCH_WARNING.md`
Contains risky changes: gutted agents.ts, mem0, Traefik overrides.

## Manus Space deploy

```bash
pnpm manus:config   # prints config
```

**Build:** `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile && pnpm build`
**Start:** `bash deploy/manus/start.sh`
**Env:** copy `env/ai.nirva.one.env.example` → `.env`

Key env vars:
- `PUBLIC_URL=https://ai.nirva.one`
- `HOST=0.0.0.0` `PORT=3000`
- `DATABASE_PATH=/app/data/nirva.db`
- `ALLOW_DEMO_AUTH=false`
- `VITE_OAUTH_PORTAL_URL` + `VITE_APP_ID` (Manus OAuth)
- `CORS_ORIGINS=https://ai.nirva.one`

## Contabo VPS deploy

```bash
bash deploy/contabo/deploy.sh
```

Env: `env/contabo.prod.env.example`
Docs: `docs/DEPLOY_CONTABO.md`

## Verify production

```bash
curl -s https://ai.nirva.one/api/health
bash scripts/verify-production.sh https://ai.nirva.one
```

Expected: `"status": "healthy"`, `"version": "0.14.4"`

## Build pipeline

```
pnpm build
  ├── vite build → dist/public/     (React SPA)
  └── esbuild server/index.ts → dist/index.js
```

`pnpm build:full` adds Storybook to dist/public/storybook/

## Docker

`docker-compose.prod.yml` — production stack (if used)
CI: `.github/workflows/` — unit tests, e2e, docker-smoke

## Server production notes

- SQLite: `getDb()` creates parent dir of DATABASE_PATH (hotfix v0.14.2)
- Listen on 0.0.0.0 not localhost
- OAuth callback: `/manus-oauth/callback` AND `/api/oauth/callback`
- Static SPA fallback for all non-API routes

## Local dev

```bash
pnpm install
pnpm go           # recommended — setup + dev
# or
pnpm dev          # port 3000
```

Optional services for full features: Ollama, Qdrant, n8n, Obsidian

## Git workflow

- `main` — production branch
- Feature branches: `cursor/<name>-8ce3`
- Hotfix: `cursor/hotfix-<name>-8ce3`
- Tags: `v0.14.4`, `v0.14.3`, etc.

## Monitoring

`.github/workflows/monitor-production.yml` — pings ai.nirva.one health
Warns (not fails) when site returns 500

## Troubleshooting

| Symptom | Fix |
|---------|-----|
| Manus 500 HTML | Republish on Manus, check start.sh + env |
| SQLite crash | Set DATABASE_PATH, ensure parent dir exists |
| Chat mock only | Start Ollama at settings.ollamaUrl |
| Memory offline | Start Qdrant or use SQLite fallback |
| Obsidian fail | Enable Local REST API plugin, check API key |
| CI fails fast | Check org billing/permissions, not just code |
